{"id":"verehren","lemma":"verehren","pos":"verb","rank":4912,"glosses":["to revere, to venerate","to adore","to worship"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈeːʁən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/De-verehren.ogg/De-verehren.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"verehre","1p":"verehren","2s":"verehrst","2p":"verehrt","3s":"verehrt","3p":"verehren"},"preterite":{"1s":"verehrte","1p":"verehrten","2s":"verehrtest","2p":"verehrtet","3s":"verehrte","3p":"verehrten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe verehrt","1p":"haben verehrt","2s":"hast verehrt","2p":"habt verehrt","3s":"hat verehrt","3p":"haben verehrt"},"future":{"1s":"werde verehren","1p":"werden verehren","2s":"wirst verehren","2p":"werdet verehren","3s":"wird verehren","3p":"werden verehren"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"verehr","2p":"verehrt"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde verehren","1p":"würden verehren","2s":"würdest verehren","2p":"würdet verehren","3s":"würde verehren","3p":"würden verehren"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"verehrt"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie verehrt ihn.","en":"She adores him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70568","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"him"}]},{"text":"Ich verehre dich.","en":"I adore you.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"you","l":"du"}]},{"text":"Seine Schüler verehrten ihn.","en":"His students adored him.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"pupil"},null,{"g":"him"}]},{"text":"Er wurde als Held verehrt.","en":"They worshipped him as a hero.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"hero"},null]},{"text":"Ich verehrte Tom.","en":"I adored Tom.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null]}]}